OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest of man after body
OL,4,Afound by coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,7,Fafter a woman was found dead at the
OL,8,Fbottom of cliffs in Alderney has been
OL,9,Ftransferred to Guernsey for
OL,10,Fquestioning, police have said.
OL,12,FEmergency services were called to an
OL,13,Farea known as The Guns on the island's
OL,14,Fwest coast after Guernsey Police were
OL,15,Falerted shortly after 23:00 BST on
OL,16,FSunday.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
