OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest of man after body
OL,4,Afound by coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FA search and rescue operation was
OL,7,Flaunched and, at about 04:28 on Monday,
OL,8,FChannel Islands Air Search reported the
OL,9,Ffirst sighting of a person in the water
OL,10,Fat the base of the cliffs. A woman was
OL,11,Flater confirmed dead.
OL,13,FDet Supt Jonathan Bancroft said a
OL,14,F44-year-old man had been arrested on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of murder and was now in
OL,16,Fpolice custody.
